// ============================================================================
//  StockRestore.restockwhitelist
//  Re-enables the STOCK art assets that Restock disables for the parts we are
//  restoring in StockRestore.cfg.
//
//  IMPORTANT: In this file, comments must be on their OWN line. Do NOT put a
//  "// comment" after a path on the same line -- Restock's whitelist parser
//  reads the whole line as the path, so a trailing comment makes the path match
//  nothing and the part fails to load. Keep paths on their own bare lines.
//
//  Each line is a GameData-relative path. A trailing "/" matches every file in
//  that folder.
// ============================================================================


// --- Command pods / probe cores ---
